-- ============================================================
-- AC-10 SEARCH_PATH REMINDER
-- ============================================================
-- getControlPool() sets:
--   search_path = roadmap_proposal,roadmap_workforce,roadmap_efficiency,roadmap,public
-- (for agenthive DB). For hiveCentral there is no equivalent pooled connection yet.
-- All SQL targeting template.* and workflow_active.* MUST use fully-qualified names.
-- Unqualified: SELECT * FROM workflow_template  ← UNSAFE
-- Safe:        SELECT * FROM template.workflow_template WHERE id = $1
